     <P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">2018</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">学年绍兴一中教师课堂教学能力比武活动方案</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Cambria> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体"><FONT size=3>一、指导思想<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">课堂教学是提升学科核心素养的主阵地，课堂教学能力是教师教书育人的核心能力。为进一步提升学科教师的课堂教学能力，进而提高教育教学质量，根据学校工作计划，决定举行</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>2018</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">学年教师课堂教学比武活动。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体"><FONT size=3>二、目标与主题<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.99"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">活动目标：</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">本次活动以课堂教学为载体，以课堂比武为平台，通过课堂的研讨达成以下三项目标：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>1. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">以评促学：通过对课堂教学设计与实施的探索和研磨，进一步完善教师教学行为，提高课堂教学的有效性。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>2. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">以评带训：以课堂的比武与展示深入推进学科校本研训，通过教师个体与教师群体相结合的课堂探索与磨课研究，开展学科问题的交流与沟通，促成学科教师的共同进步。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>3. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">以评择优：通过课堂的比武与展示，让一批能全面适应课程改革、学科专业功底厚实且学科教学效果优的教师脱颖而出。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.99"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">活动主题：</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">求真视野下的学科生本课堂教学探索</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体"><FONT size=3>三、具体安排<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">1. <SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">评比工作<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
